": 100, "originalText": "Mesures desktop", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 248028235, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures desktop", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904885258, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314085537, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "sc-1a-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 89504, "y": 274, "width": 952, "height": 297.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1PY", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Fond Navy 950.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 1110 \u00d7 446 centr\u00e9e (x 165, y 177), rayon 8, Blue 950.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo 540 \u00d7 446 \u00e0 droite (fichier 540 \u00d7 446), teint\u00e9e de Purple 500\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0(fusion de type \u00ab multiply \u00bb) ; coins de droite arrondis.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titre Inter 36 px 700 blanc, 2 lignes de 44 px ; \u00ab insights \u00bb en\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Purple 500 ; marge gauche 72, encre \u00e0 78 du haut.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe Lexend Deca 15 px 400 (14,5 mesur\u00e9), blanc \u00e0 75 %,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a03 lignes de 25 px, \u2248 350 px de large.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Statistiques en ligne : chiffres Inter 24 px 700 blancs, libell\u00e9s\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Lexend Deca 12 px blanc \u00e0 60 %, majuscules espac\u00e9es ; colonnes\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00e0 x 237, 382, 522 ; encre \u00e0 63 du bas.\n\nTailles cal\u00e9es : titre 36 (\u2264 1 %) \u00b7 texte 15 (\u2264 1,2 % \u00e0 14,5) \u00b7\nchiffres 24 \u00e0 25 (\u2264 2 %).", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 2089195681, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Fond Navy 950.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 1110 \u00d7 446 centr\u00e9e (x 165, y 177), rayon 8, Blue 950.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo 540 \u00d7 446 \u00e0 droite (fichier 540 \u00d7 446), teint\u00e9e de Purple 500\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0(fusion de type \u00ab multiply \u00bb) ; coins de droite arrondis.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titre Inter 36 px 700 blanc, 2 lignes de 44 px ; \u00ab insights \u00bb en\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Purple 500 ; marge gauche 72, encre \u00e0 78 du haut.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe Lexend Deca 15 px 400 (14,5 mesur\u00e9), blanc \u00e0 75 %,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a03 lignes de 25 px, \u2248 350 px de large.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Statistiques en ligne : chiffres Inter 24 px 700 blancs, libell\u00e9s\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Lexend Deca 12 px blanc \u00e0 60 %, majuscules espac\u00e9es ; colonnes\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00e0 x 237, 382, 522 ; encre \u00e0 63 du bas.\n\nTailles cal\u00e9es : titre 36 (\u2264 1 %) \u00b7 texte 15 (\u2264 1,2 % \u00e0 14,5) \u00b7\nchiffres 24 \u00e0 25 (\u2264 2 %).", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904885259, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1894263807, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "sc-1b-t", "type": "text", "x": 88000, "y": 1080, "width": 374, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1PZ", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 956 (mobile.jpg)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 248200530, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 956 (mobile.jpg)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904885259, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1054241322, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "sc-img-m-cadre", "type": "rectangle", "x": 88000, "y": 1120, "width": 375, "height": 956, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElem